      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 3169,
      "props": {
        "w": 304,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Plastic moment resistance, reduced for shear",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_2r",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 396,
      "y": 3159,
      "props": {
        "w": 272,
        "h": 37,
        "baseline": 23,
        "latex": "M_{pl.Rd}\\coloneq\\frac{W_{pl}f_{y}\\left(1-\\rho\\right)}{\\gamma_{M0}}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "kN m",
        "precision": 1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_2s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 3202,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Reduced for axial force, SCI P363 §10.2.1 (Blue Book)",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_2t",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 96,
      "y": 3226,
      "props": {
        "w": 345,
        "h": 29,
        "baseline": 19,
        "latex": "M_{N.Rd}\\coloneq M_{pl.Rd}\\left(1-\\min\\left(1,n\\right)^{1.7}\\right)",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "kN m",
        "precision": 1,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_2u",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 3261,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 19,
        "html": "With α = β = 2 (§6.2.9.1(6)), (6.41) is (M_Ed/M_N,Rd)² ≤ 1, i.e. the resultant M_Ed/M_N,Rd ≤ 1.",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 13,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_2v",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 3329,
      "props": {
        "w": 304,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Utilisation, plastic (n ≥ 1: axial force alone exceeds the resistance)",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_2w",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 396,
      "y": 3286,
      "props": {
        "w": 217,
        "h": 98,
        "baseline": 16,
        "latex": "\\mathrm{UR}_{pl}\\coloneq\\begin{array}{||l}\\mathrm{if}\\ n<1\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle \\frac{M_{Ed}}{M_{N.Rd}}\\right.\\\\\\mathrm{else}\\\\\\quad\\left\\Vert\\displaystyle n\\right.\\end{array}",
        "displayMode": "auto",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_2x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 3573,
      "props": {
        "w": 630,
        "h": 21,
        "html": "6.2 Class 3: elastic stresses (§6.2.9.2, (6.42))",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 14,
        "color": "#334155",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_2y",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 3629,
      "props": {
        "w": 304,
        "h": 18,
        "html": "Peak normal stress over f_y(1 − ρ)/γM0",
        "fontFamily": "Roboto",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s_secchs_2z",
      "type": "math",
      "x": 396,
      "y": 3600,
      "props": {
        "w": 286,
        "h": 38,
        "baseline": 22,
        "latex": "\\mathrm{UR}_{el}\\coloneq\\frac{\\left|N_{Ed}\\right|}{N_{V.Rd}}+\\frac{M_{Ed}\\gamma_{M0}}{W_{el}f_{y}\\left(1-\\rho\\right)}",
        "displayMode": "formulaResult",
        "displayUnit": "",
        "precision": 3,
        "autoSize": true,
        "fontSize": 16,
        "color": "#0f172a"
      }
    },
